  "caveats": [
    "This records native completion and FE commit order, not screenshots or compositor present. It corroborates dual-engine handoff but does not independently measure visible flicker or colour difference.",
    "FE viewer traces are queued for log writing; elapsed_ms/log wall timestamps are not used to compute dwell time between display and accurate. Native/FE clock domains are not directly subtracted.",
    "The on-disk running executable hash differs from the G1 probe executable de04cafeb8c2bb66c5ce52a1b58619a78f336c379b402224ba61852ca8e7679c. Hash/mtime do not prove all current source was compiled into the running executable.",
    "Served source maps prove what Vite currently serves; without app evaluation they do not by themselves prove which module revision is resident in every WebView.",
    "No customer document paths, document content, or raw command lines are retained. Document identity is SHA-256 only.",
    "Absolute log line numbers refer to the captured file prefix; verify file has not been truncated or rotated before using them."
